[EMPIRICAL TAKEAWAY]
Because traditional single-threaded/PHP-FPM worker pools process requests synchronously,
every additional concurrent user adds latency to all other requests, compounding into
504 Gateway Timeouts once the concurrency threshold exceeds the available worker pool.
Laravel Octane (Swoole) eliminates this by keeping the application persistent in memory.
